42
00:01:48.049 --> 00:01:51.349
We're then going to go to our input mapping.

43
00:01:51.349 --> 00:01:53.670
And inside of our input mapping, we

44
00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:58.150
can then define the various keys or trigger or whatever

45
00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:03.109
