56
00:02:23.389 --> 00:02:24.909
We can go down to our input.

57
00:02:24.909 --> 00:02:26.310
And we go Input Action.

58
00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.310
So there we go.

59
00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:31.310
