72
00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:58.819
I want you to do something.

73
00:02:58.819 --> 00:03:00.460
So I'm going to go ahead and save that.

74
00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:01.840
We're going to close this down.

75
00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.460
Then I hit Control-Space again.

76
00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.139
I'm going to go back up to our input.

77
00:03:05.139 --> 00:03:07.620
And we're going to grab this IMC default

